Bind Npc 32557 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 32558 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 298 "To find the lost soul.."
    Daily
    Journal for karus "You got the information on an unidentified dead body somewhere in Ronark Land. Who might be that...?"
    Journal for elmorad "You got the information on an unidentified dead body somewhere in Ronark Land. Who might be that...?"
    Collect 1 of 900071000

Requires player level >= 61 and today is thursday

Rewards
    Give 2500000 experience
    Give 200 np

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "There have been so many battles here in Ronark Land, and many Karus knights were killed in battle.  It is their effort that did not let El Morad to take over this place.\n\nAccording to the information that just came in, an unidentified corpse has been found near the central area of Ronark.  I am guessing that it could be the body of our Karus warrior... I want you to go there and confirm it.\n\nBut, you will have to hurry as I heard that El Morad is also looking for that corpse.  It will be for naught If they get the body before us."
        Topic "To find the lost soul" do
            Show quest "Okay - then go to the central area by this way.  You will have to search the central area very thoroughly.\n\nSearchng for the Lost Soul.. \n- The limit time for the mission is 10 minutes \n- You can find the dead body in the central area of Ronark Land \n- After accepting the quest, for 10 minutes, you can not use summon skill and the village (But, if you get reward, the ban is canceled)."
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "There have been so many battles here in Ronark Land, and many El Morad knights were killed in battle.  It is their effort that did not let Karus to take over this place.\n\nAccording to the information that just came in, an unidentified corpse has been found near the central area of Ronark.  I am guessing that it could be the body of our Karus warrior... I want you to go there and confirm it.\n\nBut, you will have to hurry as I heard that Karus is also looking for that corpse.  It will be for naught If they get the body before us."
        Topic "To find the lost soul" do
            Show quest "Okay - then go to the central area by this way.  You will have to search the central area very thoroughly.\n\nSearchng for the Lost Soul.. \n- The limit time for the mission is 10 minutes \n- You can find the dead body in the central area of Ronark Land \n- After accepting the quest, for 10 minutes, you can not use summon skill and the village (But, if you get reward, the ban is canceled)."
        Topic "Rejected" goto close

On in_progress
    Say "Do you know that  you are given 10 minutes??"

On ready
    If player is karus
        Say "Master, I think this is what Caesar wanted, so let's hurry back and report to him."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master, I think this is what Julius wanted, so let's hurry back and report to him."

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "Huh!! That.. That is... The dead soul didn't find the right way- Is this what we say we were lucky that this happened. If he was in the hands of El Morad he wouldn't have been able to rest even after his death... Well done, <selfname>..."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "Huh!! That.. That is... The dead soul didn't find the right way- Is this what we say we were lucky that this happened. If he was in the hands of Karus he wouldn't have been able to rest even after his death... Well done, <selfname>..."

On completed
    Say "The location of another sealed soul should be found by tomorrow... Would you like to come back tomorrow?"
